# ── Python ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/

# ── macOS ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store

# ── Tooling ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.claude/
*.log

# ── Generated field state and training artifacts ─────────────────────────────
# `.cache/` is ~69MB of checkpoints, intermediate θ₀ snapshots and downloaded
# corpora — all regenerable, none of it worth a git history. Ignore the
# directory and re-admit, by name, only the small things that cannot be
# regenerated or would be expensive to.
.cache/*

.cache/backups/
!.cache/.gitkeep

# ⭐ OLLIN'S FIRST MEMORIES — the shipped build artefact, tracked on purpose.
#
# ⚠️ THE NAMES ARE NOT `ollin_notes.*`, DELIBERATELY. Re-admitting that name
# would track the PERSONAL field, which the block below untracks for good
# reason. These are what `make_ship_field` produces — the charter verbatim and
# four measured self-check rows, identical on every install — and
# `Ollin/first_run.py` copies them into place when there is no store yet.
# ⚠️ THE θ₀ EXCEPTIONS LIVE WITH THE `*.npz` RULE FURTHER DOWN, NOT HERE.
# Git applies the LAST matching rule, so `*.npz` outranked an exception placed
# at this point and silently ignored two of the three files — the store would
# have shipped WITHOUT the address space its `feat` column is measured
# against, which is not a degraded install but a meaningless one.
!.cache/first_memories.db

# ⚠️ THE PERSONAL FIELD IS NOT TRACKED — untracked 2026-08-03.
#
# `teotl_notes.db` and `teotl_notes_theta0.npz` are ONE PERSON'S field: real
# conversations, and the θ₀ those conversations shaped. They were tracked
# deliberately, and the reason was good — θ₀ is deformed irreversibly by every
# turn, the addresses are only meaningful against the θ₀ they were measured in,
# three corruption paths were found on 2026-07-28, and git was the only undo.
#
# That reason expired when `Ollin/backup.py` landed: `/backup` takes a
# consistent snapshot of the DB *and* its θ₀ together, which is what this
# needed and what a git commit of a live SQLite file never reliably was.
#
# Meanwhile the cost was real. `test_coldstart.MUST_NOT_SHIP` has named both
# files as disqualifying an install the whole time, and the suite checks a
# clean ROOM rather than the repository, so it could never catch that a fresh
# clone arrived carrying somebody else's memories.
#
# The release ships a GENERIC field: the checkpoint below. A personal store is
# created on the first turn and belongs to whoever had that conversation.
#
# ⚠️ Earlier commits still contain these files, in plaintext from before the
# vault existed. That history needs scrubbing before the repo is public.
.cache/ollin_vault.json
.cache/field.lock

# The shipped checkpoint (ep40, ppl_nu=965.6) and its base θ₀ + vocab. 2.6MB
# once, against a training run to reproduce it.
!.cache/diag_pattern8d_shuf_final.npz
!.cache/diag_pattern8d_shuf_final_theta0.npz
# Ollin's first memories travel with their own address space — see the
# `first_memories` note above.
!.cache/first_memories_theta0.npz
!.cache/first_memories_theta0_address.npz
!.cache/qa_vocab.json

# Everything else in .cache stays out: rolling/backup checkpoints, superseded
# runs (50ep, expanded, rtr), downloaded corpora (squad_train_raw.json, 30MB),
# and the legacy apps' θ₀ files.

# ── Large corpora kept on disk, not in history ───────────────────────────────
archive/cache_snapshots/
archive/source_texts_p5vocab/
chunks/
teotl_lang/Philosophy/

# ── Results that are outputs, not source ─────────────────────────────────────
*.npy
*.npz
!.cache/diag_pattern8d_shuf_final.npz
!.cache/diag_pattern8d_shuf_final_theta0.npz
# ⚠️ REPEATED FROM THE `.cache/*` BLOCK ABOVE ON PURPOSE. There are two rules
# that match these files and git honours the LAST one, so an exception stated
# only once, higher up, is silently overridden. `git check-ignore -v <path>`
# names the rule that actually decided.
!.cache/first_memories_theta0.npz
!.cache/first_memories_theta0_address.npz
